            "dataType": "GPDouble",
            "displayName": "Measurement Transformation Factor",
            "description": "Provides a parameter value to the equations specified in the Measurement Transformation Model parameter. The parameter value is ignored when the impedance transformation is of type linear. For power and exponential impedance transformations, the value should be nonzero.The default value is 1.The value set for this parameter can be overridden on a per-demand-point basis using the ImpedanceParameter field in the input demand points.",
